OL,3,ARussia's own figures show it has lost  
OL,4,Anearly 500,000 people in Ukraine war   
OL,6,FBBC Russian has had access to more than
OL,7,F11 million death records from 2021 to  
OL,8,FSeptember 2026, after a hack by        
OL,9,FBelarusian group Cyber Partisans BY and
OL,10,FUkraine's Silent Crow.                 
OL,12,FRussia's statistics agency admitted to 
OL,13,Fa cyber-attack, but denied any         
OL,14,Fprotected information had been leaked. 
